        <div><dt>Agreed next step</dt><dd>A scoping call with the buyer and your security specialist to review the evidence request and decide whether an assessment fits.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Next action owner</dt><dd>CallTeam confirms the invitation and sends the brief. Your specialist leads the scoping discussion.</dd></div>
